+---
+id: task-002-implement-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch support.
+
+Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`. It must apply the six standard operations
+(`add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`) without mutating the input document, and
+must reject invalid patches and failed operations with an error. Add coverage for supported
+operations, JSON Pointer escaping and array semantics, root replacement, immutability, and invalid
+operations.
